mta-in (pymta)

The pure-Python inbound SMTP server in src/pymta was first built on aiosmtpd
(https://github.com/aio-libs/aiosmtpd) and still contains code derived from it:

  src/pymta/proxy_protocol.py   adapted from aiosmtpd/proxy_protocol.py
  src/pymta/smtp_protocol.py    command handling adapted from aiosmtpd/smtp.py

